1
00:00:00,990 --> 00:00:03,560
(Leonard:)I'm the one
who thought of it!

2
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,560
(Penny:)Well, didn't he do
a lot of the work?

3
00:00:05,562 --> 00:00:07,662
(Leonard:)But now he's happy
to let people think

4
00:00:07,664 --> 00:00:10,494
(Leonard:)he's responsible for everything.

5
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,530
(Penny:)And that's why you get
an iPad helicopter!

6
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:18,670
(Sheldon:)Is it my fault I have a much
bigger reputation than he does?

7
00:00:18,675 --> 00:00:19,905
(Amy:)It's not your fault.

8
00:00:19,909 --> 00:00:21,779
(Sheldon:)Is it my fault
that my name came first

9
00:00:21,778 --> 00:00:23,408
(Sheldon:)on the paper alphabetically?

10
00:00:23,413 --> 00:00:24,683
(Amy:)Not your fault.

11
00:00:24,681 --> 00:00:26,551
(Sheldon:)Is it my fault
that when the reporter cited me

12
00:00:26,549 --> 00:00:28,579
(Sheldon:)as the lead scientist
I didn't correct him?

13
00:00:28,585 --> 00:00:31,215
(Amy:)Hey, look at that pretty bird.

14
00:00:32,888 --> 00:00:34,658
(Leonard:)He always needs
all the attention.

15
00:00:34,658 --> 00:00:35,828
(Leonard:)He's such a baby.

16
00:00:35,825 --> 00:00:37,495
(Penny:)I know, I know.

17
00:00:37,494 --> 00:00:39,894
(Leonard:)I swear, he is never ever
playing with my helicopter.

18
00:00:43,599 --> 00:00:46,869
(Raj:)Okay, I'll start heating
some of this stuff up.

19
00:00:46,870 --> 00:00:48,100
(Howard:)Thanks.

20
00:00:48,104 --> 00:00:49,634
(Howard:)Oh, man.

21
00:00:49,639 --> 00:00:53,509
(Howard:)This is the boutonniere
from my high school prom...

22
00:00:53,510 --> 00:00:54,480
(chuckles)

23
00:00:54,477 --> 00:00:58,317
(Howard:)...a piece of cake
from my Bar Mitzvah.

24
00:00:58,314 --> 00:00:59,744
(Bernadette:)Did she throw
anything away?

